    "introduction": "Shawn Weston is an American actor from Pikeville, Kentucky. He began his acting career at the age of 7. In addition to acting in theatre and feature films, he is a dancer, model, gymnast, martial artist, pianist, and singer. His parents are Shawn and Shawna Thacker. He is the youngest of five children. He is best known as Logan, an Eagle Fang Karate student on Cobra Kai seasons 3, 4, 5 and 6. He was among a select number of performers chosen for Kristin Chenoweth's Broadway Bootcamp in 2022, 2023, and 2024, working with Kristin, Kenny Ortega, and many other film and Broadway professionals.",
